### Generate OTP - Chilean format with country code
POST http://localhost:3000/otp/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+56912345678"
}

###

### Generate OTP - Chilean format without plus
POST http://localhost:3000/otp/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "56912345678"
}

###

### Generate OTP - Chilean local format
POST http://localhost:3000/otp/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "912345678"
}

###

### Generate OTP - With spaces
POST http://localhost:3000/otp/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+56 9 1234 5678"
}

###

### Validate OTP
POST http://localhost:3000/otp/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+56912345678",
  "otp": "123456"
}

###

### Check OTP Status
GET http://localhost:3000/otp/status?phoneNumber=+56912345678

###

### Invalid phone number (should fail)
POST http://localhost:3000/otp/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890"
}

###

### Invalid phone number - not starting with 9 (should fail)
POST http://localhost:3000/otp/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+56812345678"
}
